    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Guest curator: Anna Petersen\n\nThe National Arts Centre Orchestra is delighted to present the second edition of our new NACO Playlist series, curated by the NAC Orchestra’s own Anna Petersen (second oboe / English horn)—a joyful and intimate look at the music that has shaped her life and art. \n\nAbout her playlist, Anna says, “these are my absolute favourite excerpts from the orchestral repertoire—music that fires me up and makes me feel.” This marvellous playlist is filled with powerful works that feature..."
      }
