    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "If the show is sold out, please contact Kelly Racicot at KRacicot@nac-cna.ca to add your group to the waitlist. \n\nThe NAC Orchestra invites families and individuals of all abilities to experience the joy of live music in a welcoming and relaxed environment. Sensory Symphony is designed for children, teens, and adults with disabilities, including autism and other sensory sensitivities, offering an inclusive and engaging orchestral experience for everyone. \n\nWhat to Expect \n\nThis adaptive performance creates a calm and flexible environment where guests can..."
      }
