    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Good Lovelies’ much-loved Christmas tour is back on at the NAC this December, bringing holiday classics, wintery favourites and a sprinkle of the band’s originals that you’ve come to love. \n\nCaroline Brooks, Kerri Ough, and Susan Passmore are Juno Award-winning songwriters and multi-instrumentalists, known for their rich harmonies and nostalgic sound. Blending folk-roots, old-time swing, bluegrass, pop, and soul, their music is a perfect fit for the season. \n\nThey’ll be joined by their “Merry Men”, a top-notch trio of musicians: Robbie Grunwald..."
      }
